/* DoL-MP v1.2.0-dev8: mp-region-moments-3.twee (32 passages: 16 Region Moment 6..7 + 16 Region Encounter 1..2) */
:: MP Region Moment Foghorn 6 [nobr]
<<set $outside to 1>><<set $location to "sea">><<effects>>
<<set $daily to ($daily or {})>><<set $mpClues to ($mpClues or {})>>
守塔人旧居外侧的导雨石槽被风吹落的枯枝堵住，积水正往储盐木柜的透气孔倒灌。
<br><br>
<<getouticon>><<link [[返回区域入口 (0:03)|MP Region Foghorn Island]]>><<pass 3>><<set $eventskip to 1>><<endevent>><</link>>
<br>
<<if $daily.mpRegMom_foghorn_6 is 1>>
今日已来过此处。
<<else>>
<div id="act-mp-region-moment-foghorn-6">
<<investigateicon>><<link "用铁钩扒石槽枯枝 (0:06)">><<pass 6>><<replace "#act-mp-region-moment-foghorn-6">>
<<set $daily.mpRegMom_foghorn_6 to 1>>
<<if ($athletics or 0) gte 250 or ($housekeeping or 0) gte 240>>
	<<if window.dolmp && window.dolmp.claimUniqueReward && window.dolmp.claimUniqueReward("reg_mom_foghorn_6")>><<money 280>><</if>>积水哗啦一声顺着排水道泻入海崖，你在槽底摸到一枚卡住的铜锚扣。<span class="green">储盐柜保住了干燥。</span><<stress -3>><<lstress>>
	<br><br>
	<<walkicon>><<link [[顺通道继续往里走 (0:04)|MP Region Moment Foghorn 7]]>><<pass 4>><</link>>
<<else>>
	冷雨溅进领口，铁钩在青石边滑脱了一下。<span class="red">你被冷水激得打了个寒战。</span><<pain 1>><<stress 3>><<gpain>><<gstress>>
	<br><br>
	<<walkicon>><<link [[定神再试 (0:03)|MP Region Moment Foghorn 6]]>><<set $daily.mpRegMom_foghorn_6 to 0>><<pass 3>><</link>>
	<br>
	<<link [[顺通道继续往里走 (0:04)|MP Region Moment Foghorn 7]]>><<pass 4>><</link>>
<</if>>
<</replace>><</link>>
<br>
<<link "搬来备用油毡压住透气孔 (0:07)">><<pass 7>><<replace "#act-mp-region-moment-foghorn-6">>
<<set $daily.mpRegMom_foghorn_6 to 1>>
<<if ($tending or 0) gte 240 or ($physique or 10000) gte 11300>>
	<<if window.dolmp && window.dolmp.claimUniqueReward && window.dolmp.claimUniqueReward("reg_mom_foghorn_6")>><<money 280>><</if>>双层油毡将雨水严密隔开，柜角夹缝里露出一小包防潮火柴。<span class="green">你妥善护住了旧居的存盐。</span><<tiredness -2>><<stress -2>><<ltiredness>><<lstress>>
	<br><br>
	<<walkicon>><<link [[沿着侧廊深入查探 (0:04)|MP Region Moment Foghorn 7]]>><<pass 4>><</link>>
<<else>>
	油毡边角被海风掀起，抽打在你的手背上。<span class="red">你按住油毡先退回屋檐下。</span><<stress 3>><<tiredness 1>><<gtiredness>><<gstress>>
	<br><br>
	<<walkicon>><<link [[先退回子区域歇脚 (0:04)|MP Region Foghorn Pier]]>><<pass 4>><</link>>
	<br>
	<<link [[调整状态再试 (0:03)|MP Region Moment Foghorn 6]]>><<set $daily.mpRegMom_foghorn_6 to 0>><<pass 3>><</link>>
<</if>>
<</replace>><</link>>
</div>
<</if>>

:: MP Region Moment Foghorn 7 [nobr]
<<set $outside to 1>><<set $location to "sea">><<effects>>
<<set $daily to ($daily or {})>><<set $mpClues to ($mpClues or {})>>
海蚀回音廊尽头的潮位标尺被牡蛎壳覆满，退潮刻度下隐约露出一格嵌在岩壁里的铜环。
<br><br>
<<getouticon>><<link [[返回区域入口 (0:03)|MP Region Foghorn Island]]>><<pass 3>><<set $eventskip to 1>><<endevent>><</link>>
<br>
<<if $daily.mpRegMom_foghorn_7 is 1>>
今日已来过此处。
<<else>>
<div id="act-mp-region-moment-foghorn-7">
<<investigateicon>><<link "用短凿铲表面牡蛎 (0:06)">><<pass 6>><<replace "#act-mp-region-moment-foghorn-7">>
<<set $daily.mpRegMom_foghorn_7 to 1>>
<<if ($physique or 10000) gte 11400 or ($skulduggery or 0) gte 250>>
	<<if window.dolmp && window.dolmp.claimUniqueReward && window.dolmp.claimUniqueReward("reg_mom_foghorn_7")>><<money 320>><</if>>牡蛎壳应声剥落，你拉动铜环从暗孔里抽出一只密封锡管。<span class="green">锡管里装着旧港守塔津贴券。</span><<stress -3>><<lstress>>
	<br><br>
	<<walkicon>><<link [[探查另一处异动 (0:04)|MP Region Encounter Foghorn 1]]>><<pass 4>><</link>>
<<else>>
	锋利的牡蛎壳划破了指尖，海浪拍湿了靴筒。<span class="red">你连忙甩干手指退上高处石台。</span><<pain 1>><<stress 3>><<gpain>><<gstress>>
	<br><br>
	<<walkicon>><<link [[定神再试 (0:03)|MP Region Moment Foghorn 7]]>><<set $daily.mpRegMom_foghorn_7 to 0>><<pass 3>><</link>>
	<br>
	<<link [[探查另一处异动 (0:04)|MP Region Encounter Foghorn 1]]>><<pass 4>><</link>>
<</if>>
<</replace>><</link>>
<br>
<<link "顺着回音壁气孔摸索暗锁 (0:07)">><<pass 7>><<replace "#act-mp-region-moment-foghorn-7">>
<<set $daily.mpRegMom_foghorn_7 to 1>>
<<if ($science or 0) gte 250 or ($history or 0) gte 240>>
	<<if window.dolmp && window.dolmp.claimUniqueReward && window.dolmp.claimUniqueReward("reg_mom_foghorn_7")>><<money 320>><</if>>你听准空腔回音按下活石，锡管顺着石槽滑进掌心。<span class="green">你凭声学巧劲解开了石壁暗格。</span><<tiredness -2>><<stress -2>><<ltiredness>><<lstress>>
	<br><br>
	<<walkicon>><<link [[转往深处查看动静 (0:04)|MP Region Encounter Foghorn 1]]>><<pass 4>><</link>>
<<else>>
	潮水轰鸣震得耳膜嗡嗡作响，一时辨不出空腔位置。<span class="red">你揉了揉耳朵暂且退回栈桥。</span><<stress 3>><<tiredness 1>><<gtiredness>><<gstress>>
	<br><br>
	<<walkicon>><<link [[退回区域入口 (0:04)|MP Region Foghorn Island]]>><<pass 4>><</link>>
	<br>
	<<link [[调整状态再试 (0:03)|MP Region Moment Foghorn 7]]>><<set $daily.mpRegMom_foghorn_7 to 0>><<pass 3>><</link>>
<</if>>
<</replace>><</link>>
</div>
<</if>>

